    "title": "Blackwell High School senior pages for Pfeiffer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "14 hours ago OKLAHOMA CITY – Bodie Jeffries, a senior at Blackwell High School, served as a page for Rep. John Pfeiffer, R-Orlando, from April 6-9 at the Oklahoma State Capitol. Bodie is the son of Justin and Heather Jeffries of Newkirk. The Oklahoma House Page Program offers current high school juniors... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
